OL,4,G0306FOutlook
OL,5,     GAfter heartbreak, Roger Hanson
OL,6,     Gturned to diving. A chance
OL,7,     Gencounter with Pacific seahorses
OL,8,     Gin a California bay led him to
OL,9,     Gbuild an underwater city and
OL,10,     Gdocument their hidden lives.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 1993, separatist forces took
OL,13,     GSukhumi, the capital of the
OL,14,     Gformer Soviet territory of
OL,15,     GAbkhazia. Georgian writer Guram
OL,16,     GOdisharia was one of thousands
OL,17,     Gforced to leave.
